OL,3,GNEWSA'My stepdaughter hid in fear
OL,4,Aduring college lockdown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said she went "into panic mode"
OL,7,Fwhen she discovered her stepdaughter's
OL,8,Fcollege had been placed into lockdown.
OL,10,FStacey Cook said the girl was left
OL,11,F"very scared" at Coventry College on
OL,12,FTuesday and hid under a table following
OL,13,Fan incident opposite the campus at Swan
OL,14,FDelights Supermarket and Cafe.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
