OL,3,GNEWSA'My stepdaughter hid in fear
OL,4,Aduring college lockdown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police said armed
OL,7,Fofficers were called to Swanswell
OL,8,FStreet where they found an imitation
OL,9,Ffirearm. Two men, both 18, and two
OL,10,Fboys, 17 and 16, were arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of possession of a firearm.
OL,12,FThey have since been released on bail
OL,13,Fwhile inquiries continue.
OL,15,FCook said she first learned of the
OL,16,Fsituation through social media, leaving
OL,17,Fher desperately trying to contact her
OL,18,Fstepdaughter.
